			"notes": "## [2.0.0] - 2026-05-05\n\n### Added\n- Official **NeoForge** compatibility via Architectury API.\n- Comprehensive localization support for Spanish, Portuguese, German and Russian.\n\n### Changed\n- Updated Minecraft version to **1.21.1**.\n- Switched from Yarn to official Mojang mappings.\n- Migrated internal project structure to **Architectury API**.\n- Refactored Patchouli book templates for better stability."
