			"notes": "**v1.1.1**\n **New Content**\n    Added several new brewing ingredients to expand experimental paths and discovery chains.\n\n **Core Systems**\n    Aspect Power System Rework: Removed the legacy workaround of duplicating an effect in the ingredient list to simulate a stronger brew. Introduced a dedicated Aspect Power system, allowing clean scaling, clearer progression, and more predictable brewing outcomes.\n\n**Quality of Life**\n    Potion & Arrow Naming Hierarchy: Implemented a strict naming priority system for all brewed potions and tipped arrows.\n        Names are now assigned based on the effect with the highest Power Level.\n        Tie-Breaker Logic: When multiple effects share the same highest level, the name defaults to the effect with higher Priority Weight (e.g., Wither or Instant Health will take precedence over Night Vision or Glowing).\n\n **Balance & Tweaks**\n    Performed a general balance pass across multiple ingredient mappings for smoother discovery and fairer gameplay.\n    Healing Brew Adjustment: Reduced the duration of Weakness and Slowness when they appear as secondary/side effects alongside Regeneration or Instant Health potions. Healing brews are now more reliable in combat while preserving strategic risk."
		},
